{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act13d5_level_act13d5_08_end",
  "groupId": "act13d5",
  "stageId": "act13d5_08",
  "title": "商業聯合",
  "storyCode": "MN-8",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act13d5/level_act13d5_08_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "99a6e900f44eb1edd91eee56e9a5e7aa3e4cca3bd567f49163ac349ae72911f2",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡西米尔 8下"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "觀眾席上有一位老人。\n這位老人對騎士競技一點都不感興趣，但為了討孫子的歡心，他還是托人買了兩張票，來看這場在報紙和電視裡被大肆宣傳的比賽。\n他皺眉，他感歎，他不知為何，這種薩卡茲人對年輕庫蘭塔的當眾處刑能夠受到歡迎。\n他並沒有覺得哪裡是錯的，因為他也是一名騎士，沒有貴族地位的征戰騎士。他只是在唾棄這場比賽，或者是薩卡茲人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "但是場上突然亮起了光芒，老人想起了，這個騎士是臨光家的小女兒。\n真可惜啊，他這樣感慨道，然後注視著那道光。在他注視著光芒的同時，觀眾席上極少數的卡西米爾人，同時想起了一個故事。\n故事發生在林河湖畔之外，要塞與城牆組成的衛戍之地。\n每逢黑夜降臨，炬火連成一片，征戰騎士的盔甲在月光下熠熠生輝，銀槍的鋒刃指向黑暗中蠢蠢欲動的敵人。\n那些無情的侵略者，使得天空變色的萊塔尼亞人遮蔽了月光，烏薩斯駭人的軍隊碾過了城牆。\n數座城邦被屈辱地帶往烏薩斯的國境，防線一退再退，“銀槍”成了那些戰爭販子嘲弄騎士的一個笑話。\n直到退無可退的城邦外圍，直到荒蕪疆土上最後的防線——\n——在卡西米爾最後的陣地，出現了一位金髮的老天馬。\n烏薩斯人在戰爭中首次敗退的那個黎明，卡西米爾遙遠的地平線上，升起了兩個太陽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "光。\n光沒有消散，光霧彌漫，將恐懼驅逐。\n此時此刻，太陽也已頷首，迎接這位歸鄉的騎士。\n......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......\n......瑪莉婭。\n站起來，瑪莉婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "......姐姐？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "瑪莉婭。\n你長大了，你做得很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "text": "不......那不是瑪莉婭的法術......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "text": "發生了什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "text": "恰爾內先生！剛才我們接到了——無胄盟守衛的通知！有一道光從競技場西北方向一公里處撞進了競技場！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "text": "速度很、很快！而且根本看不清那到底是什麼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "text": "......恐怖襲擊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "text": "不、不像是武器，是一個人，是一個庫蘭塔，但是這種速度，只可能是最頂級的騎士——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "text": "......不。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "text": "這不可能......光芒......難道......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "腐敗騎士",
      "text": "嘎.......敵人在哪兒？光太亮，看不清......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凋零騎士",
      "text": "任務，就要執行到底。不管是誰——先殺了目標！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "腐敗騎士",
      "text": "嘎啊......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "腐敗騎士",
      "text": "竟然.....用拳頭就能讓我雙腳離地......？什麼人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "骯髒的法術......備受折磨的薩卡茲感染者，“騎士”怎該是這副模樣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "腐敗騎士",
      "text": "嘎......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "姐姐......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "等等......真的是姐姐？我沒有昏過去看到幻覺嗎......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "真、真的......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "......姐姐？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "辛苦了，瑪莉婭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "嗚......姐姐......你為什麼.....才回來啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "腐敗騎士",
      "text": ".....礙事！殺掉她們！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "不，想都別想。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "腐敗騎士",
      "text": "怎......為什麼砍不動她......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凋零騎士",
      "text": "......她的光連成了一片，她壓制了我們的法術，後退，我來解決她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "在光芒中登場的——在光芒中登場的毫無疑問，是——是——是耀騎士！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "這是怎麼回事！？本該被驅逐的耀騎士竟然在此刻重回賽場！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "（喂！快去找發言人，這是什麼情況！？什——啊？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "雖、雖然不合規則！但這根本無關緊要！為了救下妹妹，冒著危險返回卡西米爾的耀騎士！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "截然不同的魄力！截然不同的氣勢！面對兩位來自地獄般的騎士依舊毫不畏懼！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "讓我們為耀騎士——歡呼吧！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "那是......瑪嘉烈？那個拿著盾的騎士，是耀騎士......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "她、她為什麼要回來卡西米爾......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "text": "我都認不出來了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "text": "......是她，她這些年......她經歷了什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "欸......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "text": "耀騎士，那個意氣風發的瑪嘉烈......她回來了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "呼......你就不能乖乖讓開嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "很遺憾，不能。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "那就是，不拼命不行了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "......如果可以的話，我倒希望你們別這麼拼命。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "再說一遍，你們無能為力，我的宗旨是除了必須要幹掉的，其他人得過且過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "只要別往競技場的方向走，至少你們還能活命——嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "——視野變亮了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "喂！老弗，看那邊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "什麼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "那個光......那個......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "是臨光老爺......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "（這個強度，不太像是瑪莉婭之前展現的法術，該不會.....）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "（可......兩位青金欸......不至於吧......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "唔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "是我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "別玩了，小天馬，收隊開溜了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "......什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "耀騎士都已經衝進去了，你還在門外攔著，沒多大意義了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "我大致猜到什麼情況了......但你們兩個一起還能失手？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "別這樣懷疑上位者啊，小天馬，本來董事會給我們的任務就只是“看住耀騎士”，又沒說一定要打......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我本來想的是，就算要打，有那個臭臉和我聯手，也不算什麼難事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "不過稍——微出了點意外情況，首先是耀騎士本人好像變強了那麼一點......其次是，她身邊多了幾個不好對付的傢伙，很麻煩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "啊......如果讓你們都覺得麻煩，那可以不用特地告訴我喔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "哦，差點忘了，特地來通知你就是因為這個，目標按照現在的行動路線往前走會和你撞上——啊，好像來不及了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "總之，千萬別動手，自求多福吧，小白金。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "哈？等等......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "真是，他們在搞什麼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "難道是瑪恩納？不對......他應該一直待在他的辦公室裡......那會是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "唔......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "（什、什麼？剛才那是......藍色的影子？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "老弗......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "我知道！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "發生什麼了？這種感覺我還真沒有過......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "......別亂動，輕聲呼吸，看好四周。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "（就像被什麼抓住了一樣......讓他們兩個都覺得麻煩的話......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "唔，來了嗎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "白角持劍的薩卡茲停下了腳步，她輕聲呼吸，她抬起眼眸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "......唉，這種的當然很麻煩啊......壓根就不是騎士啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "讓她們過去吧，反正她們也沒寫在目標名單上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "text": "......謝謝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "text": "麗茲，還走得動嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "text": "沒事的......那裡，很亮。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "text": "是臨光。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "text": "那我們跟上吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "......真是的，今天是什麼日子啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "剛才那個薩卡茲......和瑪嘉烈認識？什麼情況......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "真的是瑪嘉烈！老弗！瑪嘉烈回來了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "......別大呼小叫的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "那現在......我們呢，還要繼續嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "別那麼盯著我啊......你們撿回一條命。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "既然任務撤銷了，我也沒理由繼續攔著你們了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "你們撿回一條命喔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "想走就走？站住！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "老弗！先去競技場，別管她們了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "嘁......無胄盟......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "text": "瑪嘉烈·臨光......耀騎士！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "text": "競技場的保全呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "text": "保、保全......？但那可是耀騎士的全力衝鋒，城內又沒有準備對抗壁壘......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "text": "耀騎士......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "text": "哈哈......耀騎士......事到如今，你還要回到這裡做什麼？看一眼騎士們的墓誌銘嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "text": "恰爾內先生！我們收到了聯合會的聯絡......您......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "text": "馬科維茨先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "text": "呃？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "text": "接下來無論發生什麼，無論我是否回到這裡，都不要離開這個房間。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "text": "好、好的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "text": "是啊，我早就準備好所有的事情了......是的，恰爾內，你已經做到了所有的事情了，等著謝幕吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "text": "真是幽默......呵，哈哈哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "text": "先生.....？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "text": "啊，失禮......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "text": "恰爾內先生？您的電話......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "text": "......我知道，我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "text": "容我......離開一小會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "......騎士的技巧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "但是，用藥過度，過度依賴法術的痕跡，以及......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "腐敗騎士",
      "text": "嘎啊——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凋零騎士",
      "text": "我來壓制她！殺了目標！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "理智殘缺的薩卡茲鬥士揮舞著武器，法術，和墳墓的氣息。\n耀騎士卻一步未動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凋零騎士",
      "text": "——殺了她！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "唔，爆炸的能量驅散了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "腐敗騎士",
      "text": "——死吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "腐敗騎士",
      "text": "嘎啊......！你居然，還有力氣！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "瑪莉婭，你的傷還——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "姐姐......！你說過，為了保護他人，騎士才會選擇拿起盾牌的......對吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "但是現在，這處賽場上——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "——沒有需要姐姐擔心的弱者！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "我會成為你的盾，所以——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凋零騎士",
      "text": "讓開點，讓我把她們統統炸死！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "——全力以赴吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "腐敗騎士",
      "text": "嘎......她捨棄了盾！但你的法術呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凋零騎士",
      "text": "......這，不可能......那戰錘是她的法杖，她......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "瑪莉婭......準備好了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "......所謂騎士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "即是照亮整片大地的崇高者！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "衝入戰場的耀騎士在簡單的交鋒後竟然選擇放棄了盾牌！等等！慢著！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "還記得耀騎士帶來的雙手戰錘風潮嗎！？現在的這副模樣，捨棄了盾牌完全仰仗戰錘的模樣！這才是耀騎士原本的姿態！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "殺入重圍的耀騎士！回歸的傳奇！也許比賽結束後就會被國民院帶走，要目睹耀騎士的風采，只能是現在！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手騎士",
      "text": "這......法術，輝光......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手騎士",
      "text": "你憑什麼能安然自得地流露出那種光芒......？你這狂妄的——你真以為自己是太陽嗎！？耀騎士！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "text": "我們多久沒見過瑪嘉烈放下盾牌的樣子了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "text": "她的光......很熾熱。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "text": "她不會有事的，對吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "text": "我沒見那樣的耀騎士失敗過哪怕一次。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "text": "那個孩子，和臨光很像。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "text": "嗯，是她的妹妹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "text": "呵呵......真是個可愛的小騎士，和她真像。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凋零騎士",
      "text": "......箭矢......盡了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "腐敗騎士",
      "text": "嘎——！你的法術！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "他用法術做箭......我會擋住的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "啊，剩下的交給我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凋零騎士",
      "text": "穿不透——這該死的光！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "text": "......觀眾們安靜下來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "text": "瑪嘉烈並不佔優勢，那兩個薩卡茲很強......而且配合完美。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "但為什麼我完全不覺得瑪嘉烈會輸......甚至不覺得她有一絲一毫的劣勢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "text": "她的技巧讓人沉迷......她的神態那麼沉穩，光芒卻更加昂揚......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "text": "讓我想起臨光老爺還年輕的時候。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "不、不可思議！完全不可思議！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "瑪嘉烈的戰錘每一次揮舞，綻放出的光彩就能驅散敵人的法術！耀騎士踏步留下的龜裂處都溢滿光芒！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "這是怎樣耀眼的源石技藝！這是怎樣的戰鬥技巧！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "這才是冠軍水準！真正的騎士實力——！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "呼啊......傷口，沒那麼痛了......這也是姐姐的法術嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "（那樣的攻防戰裡，還能顧及到我——）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "腐敗騎士",
      "text": "嘎——！我的錘竟然會被......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "腐敗騎士",
      "text": "沒有武器，就用手，我要撕裂你——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凋零騎士",
      "text": "殺了她！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "姐姐露出了很奇怪的表情，那是一種......悲憫？\n因為這兩個薩卡茲的行為？因為他們被稱作騎士？還是因為......他們的遭遇？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "......瑪莉婭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "啊，我在！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "援護就交給你了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "——是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "腐敗騎士",
      "text": "動手！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凋零騎士",
      "text": "我知道！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "懺悔吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "腐敗騎士&凋零騎士",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "此時此刻，賽場已經陷入死寂。\n沒有人意識到比賽已經結束，沒有騎士在誇耀勝利，也沒有失敗者的痛聲長嚎。\n腐敗的薩卡茲跪倒在地——他們沒有倒下，耀騎士亦沒有乘勝追擊。\n她居高臨下地看著兩個薩卡茲，而後單膝跪地，伸出了手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "腐敗騎士",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "薩卡茲沒有回應。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "你們不該放棄自己的命運。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "腐敗騎士",
      "text": "不......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "腐敗騎士",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "仿佛不甘向兩個少女俯首一般，他們再不吐一字，也再無力站起。\n耀騎士轉過了身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "瑪莉婭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "欸、欸......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "我們贏了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "誰能相信自己的眼睛！誰能相信自己的眼睛！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "即使是我也無法相信！突然殺入比賽的耀騎士！！默許了這一切行為的騎士協會！！天呐，我，這——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "即使是我漫長的解說生涯也沒有見過這種情況！！雖然不知道國民院會如何處理這次亂入，但這並不影響眼下的勝利！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "我——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "text": "（莫布先生。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "（......哎唷，您總算來了！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "我深感榮幸能為大家宣佈！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "（發言人先生，我該怎麼做？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "text": "（承認她。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "勝者是！年輕的奇蹟瑪莉婭！以及，從遙遠的荒野中歸來的，人盡皆知的天馬，耀騎士！瑪嘉烈·臨光！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "text": "（沒錯，就是這樣，莫布先生，我欣賞的正是你這種煽動情緒的本事。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "text": "（穩住現場，會有人來處理的。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "讓我們為她歡呼吧——！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "text": "佐菲婭！？你去哪兒？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "馬丁！她們人呢——呃，那、那個人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "真的是瑪嘉烈......瑪嘉烈為什麼現在回來？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "但、但她怎麼說也是被流放者，怎麼不通知我們一聲就這麼——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "text": "好了，都冷靜點，說不定瑪恩納其實知道這件事......但是現在，我們得先離開這裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "text": "記者和觀眾很快就會把出入口堵得水洩不通，我們得找條路——先讓耀騎士回家。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "text": "耀騎士！！那是上一屆的耀騎士！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "text": "讓開，讓開！讓我拍照！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "各位，各位！請稍安勿躁！無論如何，我們都會確保這次比賽按照合法有序的流程進行到底！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "（下一步該怎麼辦！？聯繫不上發言人？蠢貨！去VIP位找他啊——！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "等等！那是，那是鞭刃騎士！鞭刃騎士從觀眾席突入賽場直奔耀騎士而去——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "佐菲——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "欸——佐、佐菲婭姑母！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "你......你為什麼才回來！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "——她，她剛才是不是扇了耀騎士一巴掌？啊？欸？等等，這也是值得上頭條的畫面——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "抱歉，但是，我回來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "......剛才那巴掌是我替瑪莉婭打的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "——！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "我自己的那份就算了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "嗯，謝謝你手下留情......不過，你剛才用的是右手......是什麼時候的事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "......那不是該在這聊的話題，你突然出現，國民院不會隨便允許被流放者回到卡西米爾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "在記者和國民院趕來之前，我們得趕緊開溜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "現、現在？可是比賽結果還沒......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "哪還管這麼多！這個人突然衝進來這件事比比賽重要得多！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "text": "臨光。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "麗茲，小心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "......你不用這麼擔心的，好了，攙著我的手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "這兩位薩卡茲......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "不用擔心，是我的戰友，閃靈，可以幫個忙嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "腐敗騎士",
      "text": "......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "腐敗騎士",
      "text": "我......我昏過去了......這是治癒法術？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "腐敗騎士",
      "text": "是誰......你！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "腐敗騎士",
      "text": "薩卡茲，你......你！這不可能，你？治療我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "text": "你們傷得很重，但不是在這場比賽裡留下的疤痕。藥物留下的痕跡無法根除，你們應當更愛惜自己一些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "腐敗騎士",
      "text": "滾開——別碰我！嘎啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "腐敗騎士",
      "text": "我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "腐敗騎士",
      "text": "等......等等，你.......你是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "text": "——臨光。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "嗯，我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "那兩位無胄盟的刺客始終盯著我們......現在不是在這裡歡慶勝利的時刻。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "無、無胄盟？你到底——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "text": "我們要逃嗎？臨光？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "——不。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "取得勝利的騎士絕無怯懦逃跑的理由。想要攔，就讓他們試試。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "text": "臨光，那邊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "啊......是科瓦爾先生和弗格瓦爾德先生。他們是不是發現了什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "想什麼呢！當然是要準備一條開溜的路線了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "我和他們三人會幫你們擋住觀眾的洪水，不過事後國民院一定會找到你們家裡去的，那時候就只能交給你們自己解決了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "——瑪嘉烈！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "你回來了......真好，真的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "一會老地方見，不許遲到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "嗯......當然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "text": "那是......臨光的家人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "text": "她回家了，我們都能看出她的喜悅，對吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "text": "所以，給她點空間吧。她可是耀騎士，在這個卡西米爾，又有誰能奈何得了她呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "text": "一會我們......就先去和阿米婭會合吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "瑪嘉烈抬起了頭。\n她曾經無比厭惡這塊土地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "......瑪莉婭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "呃，在？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "......該回家了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "但這裡，是她的故鄉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "......你來了。你身邊那個小跟班呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "text": "......他是下一個。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "哦......真是殘忍啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "text": "別說了，告訴我答案吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "你還真是乾脆......但你明知道答案，何必要問我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "也許你能活得更好一點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "text": "不......也許我會死在前往流放地的荒野上，也許下手的人，就是你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "......也許吧，真到那時候可別怪我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "text": "當然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "你的流放不會過國民院的流程，你今晚就得離開這裡，還有什麼留言嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "text": "瑟奇亞克還有個小兒子，事情發生的時候，他在場。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "text": "而我則想請你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "text": "......讓他永遠沒有說出真相的機會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
